<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Above the Vaulted Sky</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;When Adora had told people that she was quitting her lucrative job at the high-power firm that had plucked her straight out of law school, they had thought she was making a huge mistake. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;When Adora had said that she was dumping her whole career in the trash to become a novelist, they had thought she was either possessed by a demon or experiencing an acute mental break. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;--&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora Gray quits her dream job and then up and moves half-way across the world to stay with her best friend from high school. There, she meets another woman as dogged by the demons of her past as she. Together, they explore what it means to belong, to be, and to be truly home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fic has been completed.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>egregiousSynonyms</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
